  "content": "<p>\n\t<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74e54f708689f07006b670977243b50177f72472.png\" alt=\"weapons_logo_big\">&nbsp;<br><br><br><br>\n\t<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\"><br><br><br>\n\t<img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\" alt=\"space_gold\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>Project Babylon - 是一個模組系列，致力於打造一個協同運作的 RPG 生態系統。如同其名，武器模組為遊戲加入了許多武器。</strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\" alt=\"space_gold\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>這個模組新增了什麼？</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">\n\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t12 種武器類型，每種原版與自訂材料皆有自訂 3D 手工模型。<br>\n\t\t\t10 種新效果。<br>\n\t\t\t5 種新武器技能。<br>\n\t\t\t1 種武器招式。<br>\n\t\t\t武器被動系統。<br><br>\n\t\t\t<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3414c5657ade00d6149c0697cc76f0d2903bee86.png\"><br><br>\n\t\t</strong>\n\t</span>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 必要依賴：</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Babylon - 材料。</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Mod</a>。</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells and Spellbooks</a>。</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 可選依賴：<br></strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-acg-battlescythe-revived\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ACG Battlescythe - Revived</a>。</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Resurrection</a>。</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles</a>。</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>所有列於必要與可選依賴的模組皆需下載，以確保本模組能正常運作。<br><br></strong>\n\t<strong><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"189\"><br></span></strong>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，由我朋友製作，內含更多模型與內容！<br>\n\t查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra 模組包</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen 模組包</a>，由優秀的人們製作。<br><br><br></strong>\n\t<strong><br></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;\n\t<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8ad1d230b8024e6136522ac323c1350c6ee3052.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"139\"><br><br>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>預告片中顯示的盔甲在哪裡？</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在這裡</a> :D\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>1.21.1 版本呢？</strong> 也許有一天。\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>可以往回移植到舊版本嗎？</strong> 同上。\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \n\t\t<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" width=\"508\" height=\"118\"><br>\n\t</strong>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>回報錯誤請至：</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1482312386139652248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482312386139652248</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<strong>或者：</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n\t<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a><br><br>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">\n\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2bc05122fec4f505ec4c72474e54599c2f6bc3d.png\"><br>\n\t\t</strong>\n\t</span>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n\t<li><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 團隊製作出如此出色的模組與 API。</p></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:center\"><p>感謝 Yonchi Chikito 的支持。</p></li>\n\t<li><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 社群，讓這個模組得以實現。</p></li>\n</ul>",
